        "original_id": "86641fc7-e759-51a9-9548-08ec03e3a56d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Celtic Woman: Voices of Angels\n- Organizations: Celtic Woman\n- People: Susan McFadden, Mairead Carlin, Éabha McMahon, Tara McNeill, Méav Ní Mhaolchatha\n- Places: Dublin, Ireland, London’s West End, Piccadilly Theatre, Savoy Theatre\n- Roles: Sandy, Elle Woods\n- Works: Grease, Legally Blonde the Musical\n\nFacts:\n- Susan McFadden was born on 8 February 1983 in Dublin, Ireland.\n- Susan McFadden is an actress and singer.\n- Susan McFadden is best known for playing Sandy in Grease at the Piccadilly Theatre in London’s West End.\n- Susan McFadden is best known for playing Elle Woods in Legally Blonde the Musical at the Savoy Theatre in London’s West End.\n- Celtic Woman: Voices of Angels is the eleventh studio album by the group Celtic Woman.\n- Celtic Woman: Voices of Angels features vocalists Susan McFadden, Mairead Carlin, and Éabha McMahon, along with fiddler Tara McNeill.\n- Former Celtic Woman member Méav Ní Mhaolchatha appears on Celtic Woman: Voices of Angels as a guest.",
